<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσᾰράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ττω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dash against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑπομάζια τῇ γῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					34
				</span></i>
			/<i><span class="en">
				5.2.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρᾳ τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					14.13.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὶ τὰς θύρας, εἰς τὸ
				μέτωπον τὴν θύραν</span>, <i>slam</i> the door
			<i>in</i> one's <i>face</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				15.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nav.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; esp. of shipwreck, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ναῦς σκοπέλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Marc.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σκάφος τῷ αἰγιαλῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					2.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς πρὸς τὴν ἄκραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					48.47
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰς ναῦς</span>
			<i>wreck</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				4.32
			</span></i>; <i>shatter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν οὐρανόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					6.5
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be dashed against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμασιαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.123
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ λιθοστρώτῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					6.3.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ γῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					12.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς πέτραις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			: also intr. in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ ποταμοῦ ῥύσις τοῖς ὄχθοις π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					5.27
				</span></i>
			.</div>
